content:
**Road Hazard Protection and the replacement mounting part — Tire Sets & Treadwear Limited Warranty workmanship shares.** The mounting part added to a workmanship share follows the Road Hazard Protection certificate on the set:

- an active certificate whose plan includes mounting and balancing on replacements waives the mounting part;
- an active certificate whose plan does not include it halves the mounting part;
- a set with no active certificate keeps the mounting part as set by the line — the line's mount-and-balance charge per tire where the line charges mounting after the free period, 0 where it does not.

The mounting part is added after the tire part of the share is rounded to the cent.

**Cases (hypothetical line mounting part of $25.00):** active certificate including mounting — $0.00; active certificate without it — $12.50; no active certificate — $25.00.
